  "id": "fields-yearly",
  "title": "Fields 2024 & 2025 \u2014 cells-to-fields handover (test)",
  "description": "TEST \u2014 the candidate production product: one PMTiles archive per year (2024 & 2025) with a zoom handover \u2014 A5 resolution-7 cell aggregates (~2,075 km\u00b2 equal-area cells; per-cell count, area_ha, avg_confidence, pct_covered), every cell verbatim at z0\u20138, switching to the actual field polygons (area, confidence, country, state) at z9\u201313. Built from deduplicated staging (boundary-straddling fields collapsed, issue #9) with >350 km\u00b2 artifact polygons excluded from both layers. The per-year cell aggregates are also published as GeoParquet. Styles pair each cell metric with the matching per-field rendering across the handover.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
